---
smd: 2
title: Contract query fixture
---
:::danger Preamble danger
PREAMBLE-DANGER never replay a settlement batch.
:::
:::constraint{#CDOC scope=document} Document rule
CDOC-TEXT run inside the change window.
:::

## Prepare

:::requirement{#RPRE status=accepted} Snapshot first
RPRE-TEXT take a snapshot before any write.
:::
:::constraint{#CPRE} Replica only
CPRE-TEXT run preparation on the replica.
:::

## Operations

:::constraint{#COPS} Two people
COPS-TEXT two people on every change.
:::

### Cutover

:::requirement{#RCUT status=accepted depends-on=RPRE} Switch writes
RCUT-TEXT point the writer at the new ledger.
:::
:::agent
AGENT-CUT stop and ask a person when a check fails.
:::

### Rollback

:::constraint{#CRB} Keep the old ledger warm
CRB-TEXT keep the old ledger running for a day.
:::
:::requirement{#RRB status=accepted} Roll back
RRB-TEXT switch the writer back.
:::

## Rules

:::constraint{#CON applies-to=RCUT} Rule on the target
CON-TEXT announce the cutover first.
:::
:::decision{#D1 status=accepted} Single cutover
D1-TEXT switch in one step.
:::

## Notes

> [!CAUTION]
> CAUTION-NOTE back up the ledger first.

## History {agent=skip}

:::danger Hidden danger
HIDDEN-DANGER for people only.
:::
